<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">weather</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">weather</ansi> command reports the current weather where you
stand, including any weather system moving through the area.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

::rows
  <ansi fg="command">weather</ansi>   Report the local weather conditions.
::

Weather moves across the world as fronts. A storm born over open
water may roll inland, batter the coast, and spend itself against
the mountains. Watch room descriptions, listen for it on the roof,
and plan your travels accordingly.

Cloud, rain, snow and storms dim the light of the sun and the moons.

::rows
